{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09617","headline":"左仆射相国冀公东斋幽居 · 岑参","name":"左仆射相国冀公东斋幽居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丞相百僚长，两朝居此官。\n成功云雷际，翊圣天地安。\n不矜南宫贵，祗向东山看。\n宅占凤城胜，牕中云岭宽。\n午时松轩夕，六月藤斋寒。\n玉佩罥女萝，金印耀牡丹。\n山蝉上衣桁，野鼠缘药盘。\n有时披道书，竟日不着冠。\n幸得趋省闱，常欣在门阑。\n何当复持衡，短翮期风[抟]。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09617.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09617","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}